      "hash": "2330131b5d9793d4023783aeceb087c7880f12ec9aeb2d9334466709764226a3"
    },
    {
      "id": "39eaf794f3a0cafab0267901fdba8fadf635619e4ce41b190b04749cbe293612",
      "text": "Parametric knowledge",
      "hash": "ca4427e58e7eb25fb52c817968346f4b0283569955f17477e050362e47238167"
    },
    {
      "id": "6939c6111201b9822f1661ed135d863da597a8e3dba8db0e531942b9448ae633",
      "text": "What the model knows from training, stored in its parameters. Frozen at training time. Counterpart to contextual knowledge.",
      "hash": "24012f4804d5bbaa9cc73d284643e49852f4d72cc740531fec7c940082f489df"
    },
    {
      "id": "7c65299aaa834b323dedcce01f99884aa5ac8326e50dedc8417e0dfd6f204a63",
      "text": "Matt Pocock",
      "hash": "2fe2c13509fbd45ec2578a74ef8efda313caad4f19533a102ca7d666ed60881d"
    },
    {
      "id": "3dec61feaa2876999b5a9f58133288ec491a033c927dabab6d8c0394159ab657",
      "text": "Copy page",
      "hash": "4104018941ae3ab016c117887a91b4f933f28e36c587b8983373fe9377ce34d7"
    },
    {
      "id": "919384a5b7c35ea10970ff9e58abdc619deed260784f50706398273a63862215",
      "text": "What the",
      "hash": "189c15422c5662ff85fb5713fc395b018a66512173d8807e268f186519692a92"
    },
    {
      "id": "027153ac75482064a5b877385d7bfab2c25c63991051ebca59513bf28fd77028",
      "text": "\"knows\" from",
      "hash": "ada1e8329ed15057d81fc18d998f5246fe47d0cc4151a0142cbb3ec2714364ce"
    },
    {
      "id": "c3a5b4345fbac6f145b0e73088c06e0da2bad5cc28bc746e9f370008ff5e40d9",
      "text": ", stored in its",
      "hash": "227fc27da334da58fb6d2877731fc934910835ddfe727f167c777f79635799d2"
    },
    {
      "id": "6a5c1c43dd8889f06fc00741d17c2736a962186935909ae348d047f446f2dec5",
      "text": ". Frozen at training time — the model can't see its own parameters or update them. Detail is lost in the squeeze: billions of facts cram into a fixed number of parameters, and the rare ones blur. Source of fluency on common topics, and of fabrication on uncommon ones. Counterpart to",
      "hash": "20e1b91758e1c2ef6a3cb8fc6b896b37102f35ce53011dd59300831594cb29ef"
    },
    {
      "id": "a07549f37f4e26eb6eefe3baa35ec51c1a5cbd96a37e0e3cd16e25d28333e3b0",
      "text": "contextual knowledge",
      "hash": "c5c07eb508c755a6fe9f4ee4c829877582a9a819c31c8bb16c552c305ddd9600"
    },
    {
      "id": "114739508b88319784e8934c734c89d7e12a0acb5cca6c9bcfd225c85768c397",
      "text": "Parametric knowledge is not stored as facts. Training never gives the model a database to look things up in; it adjusts parameters until the model predicts text well, and a model that predicts text about a topic well behaves as if it knows the topic. How reliable the knowledge is tracks how often something appeared in the training data: a topic with millions of examples is reproduced accurately, for a topic with only a handful, the model guesses based on what similar topics look like. Reproducing and guessing are the same process to the model, so it can't tell which one it's doing. A fabricated answer arrives with the same fluency as a correct one.",
      "hash": "b3759b30b575bc6f16f216c99a8a4401d8eec2bde1a0cbdca3018343a5c84c50"
    },
    {
      "id": "2d1dd6399db47adfb032f7fc8287e0ac8f1822002a6765df4d203e477c83b0c0",
      "text": "Hallucination",
      "hash": "08cbd764e551fe9d33c8868ce7edae2ddad683fa405222f643580b0fd2a25e5a"
    },
    {
      "id": "33085c02ae7dccd4e72709b3cd5741ad7235e2d68744b0ce0b1f1c1f0b42831f",
      "text": "is the model guessing wrong.",
      "hash": "fc6ef9a98c5c37766dfab690ea04f1b599244ee78d1df2265d0a89301eec4708"
    },
    {
      "id": "a060320f26d3a8287483534df88c72642cdf303a5bbe34171b854fd7272574f4",
      "text": "Parametric knowledge also ages. The parameters stop changing at the",
      "hash": "a2825cfc91ae131db1e069be120903d1fca6c7ef5170a9d599a5035ea6a568d7"
    },
    {
      "id": "ba1a842c3874015411bea48ba1c4cb54d6d0fae0cdb8940b540658ec8040299d",
      "text": "knowledge cutoff",
      "hash": "46f1820f6339cd5450653d0018ffb90af1d929a074ed2e211dfa39e52b7cc408"
    },
    {
      "id": "a6bb6b90128dc36227e6555aee2707392226731148c351ba06386aadd19c8299",
      "text": ", so a library released or renamed after that date doesn't exist in them, and an API that changed is remembered in its old form.",
      "hash": "452d69b594f8ce04b194414eeab745ae45bd860e802c40b682dcbbaf71d8458b"
    },
    {
      "id": "0b749b0e780b59769f2321a6e1d1fb3dcb413cdb3d8c105e50afe6f79a26cab9",
      "text": "For both gaps — too rare and too recent — the remedy is the same: the knowledge can't be added to the parameters, so it has to be supplied as contextual knowledge instead.",
      "hash": "2336d47b8795989306e0dff4355819527d85e185e386f4c5979206ebb80da998"
    },
    {
      "id": "e3f78810ef0394c26264cf14ac1aff9fe4432386fde4ba3f99de7de880145f3d",
      "text": "Usage:",
      "hash": "2bad3eeaf33caffe3bc9b482b4934ed19eb4ec3614c12373e1a5c5f8948217da"
    },
    {
      "id": "7a6774ec8ff0433b71c6735dbab342e035ef076261937ba8f9a3eef1456eb4fc",
      "text": "\"It writes flawless React but invents methods on our internal SDK.\"",
      "hash": "f8e7df42206f58616573286f9e2ff0e9934b1c3343c6d540d90a13771534e525"
    },
    {
      "id": "02d27c21000e3dfef8b04a5dd3b454f51cdb9ca37de5b52083341a1cd51ab693",
      "text": "\"React is dense in the parametric knowledge — millions of training examples. Your SDK isn't, so the model fills in plausible-looking shapes. Load the SDK docs into",
      "hash": "b0d0bdf6e37aeb165fbafff2e37fb51826a1ddf4228ade5af78d7556bef94f3d"
    },
    {
      "id": "c64151964826aa659fa6140b1ec87b189a48fce8db2432ef03aa3ef29892d489",
      "text": ".\"",
      "hash": "b5280e40c1282ec647256eb511128edaa5e24cae99d138b33ba72f8b2d678e37"
    },
    {
      "id": "624f061d519a3926ad3db7a7b86252eb9c154acffa90324ca789f9bff592a82a",
      "text": "Previous term",
      "hash": "735604aff9e8f2192b83df4905cfc8e395613e0ce05f8ca85a1d2d1d44fd59f3"
    },
    {
      "id": "a5416b9878aa978ef0739cc232e2a48737b590a3b15321f9b1fdc8c9c22de4b9",
      "text": "Next term",
      "hash": "5219c7ebdc0e098aa6db6f09e405c1b17ab75f1082862906a872e10a16818f9e"
    },
    {
      "id": "64c47b0a24762965451d504b73865a6de1c7eca51e3fe4e8fecb60cb9a45ef5b",
      "text": "Knowledge cutoff",
      "hash": "da7752dcbdc5ec6cb75299abd8a5293085358a207b7a1383db9e1ce36002d71f"
    },
    {
      "id": "ba5dfaf47929fbc99e13acc2c9a1450a2bf71d0405acd371dc185236625a8495",
      "text": "Want more than vocabulary?",
      "hash": "5d5500a083006a1606e84a03c018904d01364631c6baea4c7a3f8f3f62bf94dc"
    },
